    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d65">

                <pb facs="0134" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg44"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1080</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-11T00:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 11,
                                1918, 12 a.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 11, 10.17
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Drysdale already in Siberia to
                    investigate report. Do you desire your instruction of February 9, 6 p.m.,
                    carried out?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Reinsch</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
